pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 40, 600, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        01 · 为什么是现在
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 62, 848, 36]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        你已经会写 Prompt 了，为什么还是「差点什么」？
  - elementId: s1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [56, 132, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:file-lines"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: s1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 130, 520, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        场景一：让 AI 写巡检报告
  - elementId: s1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 156, 520, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        你得把平台里 6 处数据，一条条复制粘贴进对话框，它才开始写
  - elementId: s1-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 140, 264, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        卡点：人在当「搬运工」
  - elementId: s1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 188, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: s2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [56, 210, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:plug-circle-xmark"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: s2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 208, 520, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        场景二：让 AI 排查数据异常
  - elementId: s2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 234, 520, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        它不知道我们平台的接口，连监测数据都拿不到，只能凭空分析
  - elementId: s2-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 218, 264, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        卡点：AI 没有「手」（工具）
  - elementId: s2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 266, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: s3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [56, 288, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:eye"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: s3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 286, 520, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        场景三：让它「持续盯着」某监测断面
  - elementId: s3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 312, 520, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        一次问答结束，它就停了 —— 没有人替它值下一班
  - elementId: s3-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 296, 264, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        卡点：没有「循环」
  - elementId: s3-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 344, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: concl-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 366, 848, 66]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleG"}
  - elementId: concl-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 366, 4, 66]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: concl-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 366, 810, 66]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$pine"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        结论：单次问答解决不了连续的工作 —— 这正是智能体要解决的问题。
  - elementId: check-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 450, 600, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        现场对照：这三个场景，你遇到过哪几个？
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 502, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 510, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        东方智感 · AI 内训第三期
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [854, 510, 50, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        04
